AN HONEST NOTE ON WHAT IS ENFORCEABLE
─────────────────────────────────────
Individual prices are facts. In the United States facts are not copyrightable
(Feist v. Rural Telephone, 499 U.S. 340), so no licence can restrict quoting
that AWS charges a particular rate — nor should one try. What copyright can
reach is the compilation: the selection, normalization, and arrangement above.
The European Union additionally recognises sui generis database rights, which
this licence covers where they apply.

In practice this licence sets an expectation rather than a threat. The point
of choosing CC BY over public domain is attribution: if you build on this,
link back.


